r music  you're going to be questioned for every  lyric when you're doing interviews  people are going to say so what did you  mean by this what did you do that so i  don't know if it's a safe thing to do  but it looks like it's amicable and  they're they're friends and and you will  love her forever because it was his  first  really long strong relationship  not forever
 

